    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index rose to a seven-week high of 5,910 points, up by 1,168 points from 12 September. The W.Australia-China iron ore spot voyage rate increased by $1.10/t to $8.85/t, while the round-voyage rate jumped by $5,250/day to $12,500/day.",
